    <string name="activity_heading">Activity from steps</string>
    <string name="activity_info">Based on cumulative CIRQA step counts of the last minutes. The mode is a rough display heuristic: steps prove neither sitting nor a particular sport. With too few or outdated values it stays unknown.</string>
